#: kiconedit.cpp:756
msgid ""
"Icon draw grid\n"
"\n"
"The icon grid is the area where you draw the icons.\n"
"You can zoom in and out using the magnifying glasses on the toolbar.\n"
"(Tip: Hold the magnify button down for a few seconds to zoom to a predefined "
"scale"
msgstr ""
"Icon draw grid\n"
"\n"
"Li grile di dessin po les imådjetes, c' est li plaece ki vos î poloez "
"dessiner vos imådjetes.\n"
"I gn a moyén di rloukî did pus près ou did pus lon avou li loupe è bår ås "
"usteyes.\n"
"(Racsenge: efoncîz li boton del loupe sacwantès segondes po passer a èn "
"agrandixhmint defini divant"

#: kiconedit.cpp:761
msgid ""
"Rulers\n"
"\n"
"This is a visual represantation of the current cursor position"
msgstr ""
"Rûles\n"
"\n"
"Po mostrer eyu-ce ki li curseur si trove"

#: kiconedit.cpp:765
msgid ""
"Statusbar\n"
"\n"
"The statusbar gives information of the status of the current icon. The "
"fields are:\n"
"\n"
"\t- Cursor position\n"
"\t- Size\n"
"\t- Zoom factor\n"
"\t- Number of colors\n"
"\t- Application messages"
msgstr ""
"Statusbar\n"
"\n"
"Li bår ås informåcions vos esplike çu ki s' passe avou l' imådjete ki vos "
"ovrez dissu. Les tchamps sont:\n"
"\n"
"\t- Plaece do curseur\n"
"\t- Grandeu\n"
"\t- Agrandixhmint\n"
"\t- Nombe di coleurs\n"
"\t- Messaedjes evoyîs på programe"

#: kiconedit.cpp:774
msgid ""
"Preview\n"
"\n"
"This is a 1:1 preview of the current icon"
msgstr ""
"Vey\n"
"\n"
"Po vey l' icone ki vos ovrez dsu avou èn agrandixhmint di 1:1"

#: kiconedit.cpp:777
msgid ""
"System colors\n"
"\n"
"Here you can select colors from the KDE Icon Palette."
msgstr ""
"Coleurs do sistinme\n"
"\n"
"Droci, vos poloz tchwezi des coleurs dins li palete KDE."

#: kiconedit.cpp:780
msgid ""
"Custom colors\n"
"\n"
"Here you can build a palette of custom colors.\n"
"Just double-click on a box to edit the color"
msgstr ""
"Coleurs da vosse\n"
"\n"
"Droci, vos poloz arindjî vosse prôpe palete di coleurs.\n"
"Clitchîz deus feyes so ene boesse po candjî li coleur"

#: kiconedit.cpp:786
msgid ""
"New\n"
"\n"
"Create a new icon either from a template or by specifying the size"
msgstr ""
"Novea\n"
"\n"
"fé ene novele imådjete, a pårti d' on modele ou tot djhant si grandeu"

#: kiconedit.cpp:789
msgid ""
"Open\n"
"\n"
"Open an existing icon"
msgstr ""
"Drovi\n"
"\n"
"Drovi ene imådjete k' egzisteye dedja"

#: kiconedit.cpp:792
msgid ""
"Save\n"
"\n"
"Save the current icon"
msgstr ""
"Schaper\n"
"\n"
"Schaper l' imådjete ki vos ovrez dsu"

#: kiconedit.cpp:795
msgid ""
"Print\n"
"\n"
"Opens a print dialog to let you print the current icon. (Doesn't realy work "
"as expected"
msgstr ""
"Rexhe\n"
"\n"
"Drove on purnea avou sacwantès kesse po rexhe voste imådjete. (Mins ça n' va "
"nén co come ça duvreut"

#: kiconedit.cpp:799
msgid ""
"Cut\n"
"\n"
"Cut the current selection out of the icon\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"Côper\n"
"\n"
"Côpe çu k' est tchwezi foû di voste imådjete\n"
"\n"
"(Racsegne: i gn a moyén di tchwezi des rectangues ou des ronds)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:803
msgid ""
"Copy\n"
"\n"
"Copy the current selection out of the icon\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"Copyî\n"
"\n"
"Po copyî çu k' est tchwezi foû di l' imådjete\n"
"\n"
"(Racsegne: i gn a moyén di tchwezi des rectangues ou des ronds)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:807
msgid ""
"Paste\n"
"\n"
"Paste the contents of the clipboard into the current icon.\n"
"\n"
"If the contents is larger than the current icon you can paste it in a new "
"window.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: Select \"Paste transparent pixels\" in the configuration dialog if you "
"also want to paste transparent)"
msgstr ""
"Aclaper\n"
"\n"
"Aclape çu k' i gn a dvins li tchapea emacralé dins voste imådjete.\n"
"\n"
"Si l' ådvins a aclaper est pus grand ki voste imådjete, vos l' poloz aclaper "
"dins onnovea purnea.\n"
"\n"
"(Racsegne: Tchwezixhoz \"Aclaper tot veyant hute des pixels\" dins li dviez "
"d' apontiaedje si vos voloz aclaper yåk k' on voet hute)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:814
msgid ""
"Select\n"
"\n"
"Select a section of the icon using the mouse.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: You can make both rectangular and circular selections)"
msgstr ""
"Tchwezi\n"
"\n"
"Tchwezi ene coine di l' imådjete avou vosse soris.\n"
"\n"
"(Racsegne: i gn a moyén di tchwezi des rectangues ou des ronds)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:818
msgid ""
"Resize\n"
"\n"
"Smoothly resizes the icon while trying to preserve the contents"
msgstr ""
"Candjî li grandeu\n"
"\n"
"Candje li grandeu di l' imådjete mins tot sayant do n' nén bodjî a l' ådvins"

#: kiconedit.cpp:821
msgid ""
"Gray scale\n"
"\n"
"Gray scale the current icon.\n"
"(Warning: The result is likely to contain colors not in the icon palette"
msgstr ""
"Totes sôrtes di gris\n"
"\n"
"Riponde voste imådjete avou totes sôrtes di gris.\n"
"(Advertixhmint: do côp, vos riskez d' avu des coleurs ki n' sont nén el "
"palete"

#: kiconedit.cpp:825
msgid ""
"Zoom out\n"
"\n"
"Zoom out by one.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: Hold the button down for a few seconds to zoom to a predefined scale"
msgstr ""
"Vey did pus lon\n"
"\n"
"Vey did pus lon, d' ene asdjambleye.\n"
"\n"
"(Racsegne: tchôkez li boton sacwantès segondes po-z avu èn agrandixhmint "
"defini dvant"

#: kiconedit.cpp:829
msgid ""
"Zoom in\n"
"\n"
"Zoom in by one.\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: Hold the button down for a few seconds to zoom to a predefined scale"
msgstr ""
"Vey did pus près\n"
"\n"
"Vey did pus près, d' ene asdjambleye.\n"
"\n"
"(Racsegne: tchôkez li boton sacwantès segondes po-z avu èn agrandixhmint "
"defini dvant"

#: kiconedit.cpp:833
msgid ""
"Toggle grid\n"
"\n"
"Toggles the grid in the icon edit grid on/off"
msgstr ""
"Grile / sins grile\n"
"\n"
"Po vey ou ni pus vey li grile"

#: kiconedit.cpp:836
msgid ""
"New window\n"
"\n"
"Opens a new Icon Editor window."
msgstr ""
"Novea purnea\n"
"\n"
"Po drovi ene novele fignese dins l' aspougneu d' imådjetes."

#: kiconedit.cpp:839
msgid ""
"Whats is...?\n"
"\n"
"Well since you're reading this I guess you found out ;-)"
msgstr ""
"C' est cwè di ...?\n"
"\n"
"Come vos lejhoz çouci, dji supôze ki vos avoz trové ;-)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:842
msgid ""
"Drag source\n"
"\n"
"From this button you can drag out a copy of the current icon and drop it on "
"a drop enabled window, eg. another Icon Editor.\n"
"\n"
"(Note: The drag source uses the QT XDND protocol which is not yet standard "
"in KDE)"
msgstr ""
"Saetchî li soûrdant\n"
"\n"
"Avou ci boton ci, i gn a moyén do saetchî ene copeye di voste imådjete èt "
"del bodjîdins on purnea (ki sait rshure), metans: èn ôte purnea di voste "
"aspougneu d' imådjetes.\n"
"\n"
"(Rawete: li saetchaedje si sieve do protocole QT XDND, nén co standård dins "
"KDE)"

#: kiconedit.cpp:850
msgid ""
"Free hand\n"
"\n"
"Draw non-linear lines"
msgstr ""
"A mwin leveye\n"
"\n"
"Po dessiner des royes nén droetes"

#: kiconedit.cpp:853
msgid ""
"Flood fill\n"
"\n"
"Fill adjoining pixels with the same color with the current color"
msgstr ""
"Fé passer li coleur hute\n"
"\n"
"Mete les pixels a costé è coleurs, avou li minme coleur ki li cene ki vos "
"eployîz pol moumint"

#: kiconedit.cpp:856
msgid ""
"Rectangle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a rectangle"
msgstr ""
"Rectangue\n"
"\n"
"Dessiner on rectangle"

#: kiconedit.cpp:859
msgid ""
"Filled rectangle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a filled rectangle"
msgstr ""
"Rectangue rimpli\n"
"\n"
"Dessiner on rectangle rimpli"

#: kiconedit.cpp:862
msgid ""
"Circle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a circle"
msgstr ""
"Ceke\n"
"\n"
"Dessiner on ceke"

#: kiconedit.cpp:865
msgid ""
"Filled circle\n"
"\n"
"Draw a filled circle"
msgstr ""
"Ceke rimpli\n"
"\n"
"Dessiner on ceke rimpli"

#: kiconedit.cpp:868
msgid ""
"Ellipse\n"
"\n"
"Draw an ellipse"
msgstr ""
"Ceke asplati\n"
"\n"
"Dessiner on ceke asplati"

#: kiconedit.cpp:871
msgid ""
"Filled ellipse\n"
"\n"
"Draw a filled ellipse"
msgstr ""
"Ceke asplati rimpli\n"
"\n"
"Dessiner on ceke asplati rimpli"

#: kiconedit.cpp:874
msgid ""
"Line\n"
"\n"
"Draw a straight line vertically, horizontically or in 45 dgr. angles"
msgstr ""
"Roye\n"
"\n"
"Dessiner ene droete roye d' astampeye, di coûtcheye ou avou des ingleyes di "
"45 grés"

#: kiconedit.cpp:877
msgid ""
"Spray\n"
"\n"
"Draw scattered pixels in the current color"
msgstr ""
"Spritchî\n"
"\n"
"Dessiner des pixels sitramés dins li coleur tchwezeye"

#: kiconedit.cpp:880
msgid ""
"Find\n"
"\n"
"The color of the pixel clicked on will be the current drawcolor"
msgstr ""
"Trover\n"
"\n"
"Li coleur do pixel ki vos clitchîz dsu divénrè vosse coleur tchwezeye"

#: kiconedit.cpp:883
msgid ""
"Erase\n"
"\n"
"Erase pixels. Set the pixels to be transparent\n"
"\n"
"(Tip: If you want to draw transparent with a different tool then first click "
"on \"Erase\" then on the tool you want to use)"
msgstr ""
"Disfacer\n"
"\n"
"Disfacer des pixels. Çu ki vout dîre k' ont voet hute di ces pixels la\n"
"\n"
"(Racsegne: Si vos voloz dessiner yåk k' on voet hute avou èn ôte osti, vos "
"dvoz clitchîz so \"Disfacer\" et adon so l' osti ki vos v' voloz siervi)"

